</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/758e9a80-89c3-11f1-bf29-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-27T135112Z-581573885-RC2DMMA66Q01-RTRMADP-3-EUROPE-WEATHER-FRANCE-WILDFIRE.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/758e9a80-89c3-11f1-bf29-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-27T135112Z-581573885-RC2DMMA66Q01-RTRMADP-3-EUROPE-WEATHER-FRANCE-WILDFIRE.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">19d328a0-89c8-11f1-a1d1-879946ad627e</guid><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 14:55:30 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>瑞迪</dc:creator></item><item><category>亚洲</category><title>金正恩胞妹金与正谴责东盟呼吁朝鲜无核化</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%B2/20260727-%E9%87%91%E6%AD%A3%E6%81%A9%E8%83%9E%E5%A6%B9%E9%87%91%E4%B8%8E%E6%AD%A3%E8%B0%B4%E8%B4%A3%E4%B8%9C%E7%9B%9F%E5%91%BC%E5%90%81%E6%9C%9D%E9%B2%9C%E6%97%A0%E6%A0%B8%E5%8C%96</link><description>
